{"seq":1,"slug":"capture-resolution","title":"高分辨率捕获：拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/practice/capture-resolution","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高分辨率捕获-拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片\">高分辨率捕获：拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片</h1><p>玩家在 1080p 屏幕上取好了景，按下快门，最终却导出了一张 8K 的成片——分辨率是屏幕的十六倍。这不是魔法，而是拍照模式区别于「系统截图键」的核心技术能力：把画面渲染到远超当前显示分辨率的尺寸。<a href=\"../foundations/photo-mode-value\">价值与营销</a> 说过，画质是传播质量的下限；一张发到社交平台被压缩后仍清晰的照片，靠的就是这里讲的高分辨率捕获。这一篇讲清楚怎么在有限显存里渲染出超大画面、如何做超采样降噪、以及 2026 年 AI 超分带来的新选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-屏幕分辨率不是渲染分辨率的上限\">核心概念：屏幕分辨率不是渲染分辨率的上限</h2><p>一个根深蒂固的误区是「显示器是 4K，最多只能截 4K」。实际上，渲染目标（render target）的尺寸和显示器分辨率完全解耦——只要显存装得下，可以渲染任意大的画面，再缩放显示或直接保存。拍照捕获有三条通往高分辨率的技术路径，可单用也可叠加：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家按下快门] --&gt; B{目标分辨率策略}&#10;  B --&gt; C[直接大分辨率渲染&lt;br/&gt;显存足够时]&#10;  B --&gt; D[分块渲染 tiled&lt;br/&gt;显存不足时]&#10;  B --&gt; E[超采样后降采样&lt;br/&gt;SSAA 抗锯齿]&#10;  B --&gt; F[AI 超分&lt;br/&gt;DLSS/FSR 放大]&#10;  C --&gt; G[拼合/缩放]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[编码为 PNG/JPEG&lt;br/&gt;写入元数据]\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家按下快门] --&gt; B{目标分辨率策略}\n  B --&gt; C[直接大分辨率渲染&lt;br/&gt;显存足够时]\n  B --&gt; D[分块渲染 tiled&lt;br/&gt;显存不足时]\n  B --&gt; E[超采样后降采样&lt;br/&gt;SSAA 抗锯齿]\n  B --&gt; F[AI 超分&lt;br/&gt;DLSS/FSR 放大]\n  C --&gt; G[拼合/缩放]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[编码为 PNG/JPEG&lt;br/&gt;写入元数据]</pre><p>直接大渲染最简单但受显存限制；分块渲染绕开显存墙；超采样用「大渲染再缩小」换抗锯齿；AI 超分用神经网络把小图放大。下面依次展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分块渲染-用显存的方式渲染放不下的画面\">分块渲染：用显存的方式渲染放不下的画面</h2><p>要渲染一张 8K（7680×4320，约 3300 万像素）画面，仅一个 HDR 颜色缓冲加深度、法线等 G-Buffer，显存需求就可能突破数 GB，很多设备一次性放不下。分块渲染（tiled rendering）是经典解法：把目标大画面切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个瓦片，每个瓦片单独渲染成一小块，最后拼成完整大图。</p>\n<p>关键在于每个瓦片要用<strong>同一台相机、但不同的投影子视锥</strong>。把原始投影矩阵的视锥在图像平面上切成网格，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 块用对应的偏移投影渲染，就能保证拼接处严丝合缝。总瓦片数与放大倍数的关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>瓦片数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{瓦片数} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{W_{target}}{W_{tile}} \\right\\rceil \\times \\left\\lceil \\frac{H_{target}}{H_{tile}} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">瓦片数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>有意思的是，2026 年 AMD 在 AI 超分里也用了同一思路——把高分辨率图切成能塞进 NPU 片上缓存的瓦片，逐块处理再拼接，据其技术文章可降低约 40% 延迟（<a href=\"https://www.amd.com/en/developer/resources/technical-articles/2026/upscale-everything-super-resolution-across-amd-hardware-.html\">AMD, 2026</a>）。分块渲染的两个坑要注意：一是屏幕空间效果（SSAO、屏幕空间反射）在瓦片边界会因缺少邻块信息而出现接缝，需要渲染带重叠边的瓦片再裁掉；二是分块渲染耗时较长，必须配一个进度提示，否则玩家以为卡死，这与 <a href=\"photo-mode-performance\">性能与超采样</a> 讨论的暂停态渲染节奏相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超采样-以清晰换算力\">超采样：以清晰换算力</h2><p>超采样抗锯齿（SSAA）的思路是「渲染得比需要的更大，再缩小」。以 2× 超采样为例：目标 4K，实际渲染 8K，再降采样到 4K。每个最终像素由渲染时的 4 个子像素平均而来，边缘的锯齿被平滑成渐变，得到远比运行时 TAA 干净的画质。降采样后每个输出像素的值是覆盖它的子样本均值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{out}(x,y) = \\frac{1}{k^2}\\sum_{i=0}^{k-1}\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1} C_{render}(kx+i,\\,ky+j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2499em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是每维超采样倍率。SSAA 的代价是算力随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长，但拍照模式是暂停态、允许单帧渲染耗时几百毫秒甚至数秒，这个在游玩时不可接受的成本在这里完全负担得起——这正是拍照捕获能做到运行时做不到画质的根本原因。有趣的是，DLSS 这类 AI 方案的训练数据本身就是用超采样到 64 samples/pixel 生成的「完美帧」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_learning_super_sampling\">DLSS, Wikipedia</a>），可见超采样是画质的黄金标准，只是太贵不能实时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-超分与全景-2026-年的新选项\">AI 超分与全景：2026 年的新选项</h2><p>除了老实渲染，2026 年多了 AI 超分这条捷径。NVIDIA DLSS 4 在 2025 年 CES 首发，采用基于 Transformer 的超分辨率模型；到 2026 年 CES 又推出 DLSS 4.5，第二代 Transformer 模型覆盖 400 多款游戏（<a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/news/dlss-4-5-dynamic-multi-frame-gen-6x-2nd-gen-transformer-super-res/\">NVIDIA, 2026</a>）。拍照模式可以借力：以较低分辨率渲染，再用 AI 超分放大到 8K，用可接受的时间换接近原生的清晰度。代价是 AI 超分依赖特定硬件、且对高频细节偶有「臆造」，追求绝对真实的玩家仍会选原生超采样。</p>\n<p>下表对比几种输出模式的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输出模式</th>\n<th>画质</th>\n<th>时间成本</th>\n<th>显存需求</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>屏幕分辨率截图</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快速留念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接大渲染</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>显存充裕的 PC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分块渲染</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（分块）</td>\n<td>超高分辨率、显存受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSAA 超采样</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>追求极致抗锯齿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 超分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有 RTX 等硬件、要快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>除了分辨率，还有两类特殊输出：<strong>全景/360 度</strong>（渲染立方体贴图再展开成等距柱状投影，用于 VR 观看或全景分享）和<strong>多宽高比裁剪</strong>（承接 <a href=\"../tools/composition-tools\">构图工具 (景深/视场)</a> 选定的 21:9 或 9:16，在捕获阶段按比例裁剪或调整视锥）。这些都建立在「渲染分辨率与显示解耦」这个核心认知之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渲染分辨率与显示器分辨率完全解耦，这是拍照捕获能拍出「比屏幕更清晰」照片的前提。</li>\n<li>分块渲染用同相机不同子视锥逐瓦片渲染再拼接，绕开显存墙，但要处理屏幕空间效果的边界接缝并配进度提示。</li>\n<li>超采样（SSAA）渲染更大再降采样换抗锯齿，成本随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长，但暂停态允许长耗时，故拍照能做到运行时做不到的画质。</li>\n<li>2026 年 AI 超分（DLSS 4/4.5、FSR）提供低成本放大到 8K 的捷径，代价是依赖硬件、偶有细节臆造。</li>\n<li>全景 360 与多宽高比裁剪是两类特殊输出，都建立在「分辨率与显示解耦」的核心认知上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"photo-mode-performance\">性能与超采样</a>（暂停态渲染的性能与节奏）、<a href=\"../tools/composition-tools\">构图工具 (景深/视场)</a>（宽高比决定裁剪尺寸）、<a href=\"../foundations/photo-mode-value\">价值与营销</a>（画质即传播下限）、<a href=\"photo-mode-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>（成片写入元数据）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：GPU 瓶颈与显存管理，见性能优化 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">GPU 瓶颈</a> 与 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">内存管理</a>；图形管线的抗锯齿基础，见 <a href=\"../game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/graphics-pipeline-overview\">图形管线总览</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高分辨率捕获：拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片","id":"高分辨率捕获-拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：屏幕分辨率不是渲染分辨率的上限","id":"核心概念-屏幕分辨率不是渲染分辨率的上限"},{"level":2,"text":"分块渲染：用显存的方式渲染放不下的画面","id":"分块渲染-用显存的方式渲染放不下的画面"},{"level":2,"text":"超采样：以清晰换算力","id":"超采样-以清晰换算力"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 超分与全景：2026 年的新选项","id":"ai-超分与全景-2026-年的新选项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"角色与表情控制：让照片里的人活过来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/tools/character-posing"},"next":{"title":"性能与超采样：暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/practice/photo-mode-performance"}}